  "description": "In high school, Choi Sung-Jae confessed to his best friend Geon-Hu, but was firmly rejected. Despite staying friends and going to college, Sung-Jae is still ardently in love with Geon-Hu and makes a wish on a shooting star for just one chance to sleep with him. The next day he wakes up in the body of Lee Chung-Min, a fellow classmate and...Geon-Hu's lover?! Chung-Min is now in Sung-Jae's body and makes the wild suggestion that they have a threesome. Is Sung-Jae's wish coming true this easily?!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
